        "Native popovers are non-modal and cannot replace the modal x-popover contract without behavioral loss."
      ],
      "xtendHypotheses": [
        "Non-modal x-popover and x-tooltip can be evaluated separately from x-dialog and modal overlay ownership."
      ],
